{"metadata":{"role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"Sessions"}],"symbolKind":"module","title":"Sessions","externalID":"Sessions","roleHeading":"Framework"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sessions are opt-in. Add the sessions enricher to the ones a tracker is built with, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s worker sets each record’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionKey"},{"text":" to its session’s identifier. A session goes on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while each event comes less than the timeout (30 minutes by default) after the one before it,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"measured between the records’ timestamps. The first event after a longer gap starts a new session.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher tracks "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" before each session’s first event, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before that from the second session on, carrying the ended session’s duration. A run’s last session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has no "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": a session ends only when an event comes after the timeout. Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kinds:"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"track only one kind of session event, or neither; every record still carries its key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineConte